<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Godo Steel rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Godo Steel rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd has assigned Godo Steel Ltd a &quot;3&quot; rating, Nikko brokers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;3&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects will underperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
